  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Artlink Festival Fortress</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ArtLink Festival  through musical performances and synergy with cultural heritage and nature, engages talented artists from Serbia and the Region in  Camerata Balcanica orchestra and guests from around the world, in unique art festival concept &#x2013; &#x201c;Festival Cities &amp;amp; Artists for Nature&#x201d; at Belgrade Fortress, with special programs at Felix Romuliana World Heritage site. The artistic concept of a festival city is dedicated to nature, with the aim of involving artists, community, institutions, in order to raise awareness of the importance and value of the protection of the nature. Art dialogues, innovative outdoor art presentations, creative workshops, campaigns and performances takes place under the motto &#x2013; &#x201c;Artists for Nature&amp;quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
